  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "feat(utf8builder): unify append API and introduce operator+ for fluent UTF-8 building\n\n      - Synchronized all append-style APIs to ensure consistent behavior across Utf8Builder.\n      - Added operator+ overloads for byte, char, numeric primitives, Guid, TimeSpan, DateTime, and Type.\n      - Operator+ now acts as a zero-cost wrapper over Append(), fully inlined by JIT.\n      - Enables fluent chaining (builder + \"abc\" + 123 + dt) without performance loss.\n      - Internal core updated to use += in selective paths to validate top-level API correctness.\n\n      Upcoming update:\n      - Core system will migrate from direct Append() calls to operator+ usage for full API unification.\n      - This ensures the public-facing syntax is the same as internal logic, improving maintainability and consistency.",
